  "question": {
    "text": "The line <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math> interesects the ellipse <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math> at two points. The point of intersection of the tangents to the ellipse at these points is",
